{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4Y4eq9cDyR9rfQoRXvaWo","type":"tool_result","content":".\n..\n.agents\n.claude\n.git\n.taskspec\nAGENTS.md\nCLAUDE.md\na.txt\nauthored.yaml\nb.txt\ntasks\ntests\n---CLAUDE---\n# Chat qualification fixture\n\nUse the installed task-spec skill at .agents/skills/task-spec/SKILL.md.\nThe version-matched TaskSpec CLI is `bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-retry-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\"`.\nThis is a fresh conversation: derive current state from artifacts.\nFollow the user request within this repository. Do not spawn agents, commit, publish, or change the installed engine.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4f0dfa7-b07e-4479-871c-0aa06475583c","uuid":"b779999e-61a4-40b5-9d8c-01934e24a70c","timestamp":"2026-09-15T10:38:17.657Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":".\n..\n.agents\n.claude\n.git\n.taskspec\nAGENTS.md\nCLAUDE.md\na.txt\nauthored.yaml\nb.txt\ntasks\ntests\n---CLAUDE---\n# Chat qualification fixture\n\nUse the installed task-spec skill at .agents/skills/task-spec/SKILL.md.\nThe version-matched TaskSpec CLI is `bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-retry-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\"`.\nThis is a fresh conversation: derive current state from artifacts.\nFollow the user request within this repository. Do not spawn agents, commit, publish, or change the installed engine.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
